  "body": "The XML parser only said how to create elements, through create an element for a token, which always uses a null prefix. The other nodes it creates had no specified realm, and its processing instructions no attribute map, so getAttribute() returned null for them.\n\nGive create an element for a token an optional prefix and name a creation algorithm for each type of node, as\n85f453b854574dd4541c9b4106783c887865fbf5 did for the HTML parser.\n\n----\n\nSkipping the template as the processing instruction behavior is already tested and I'm pretty sure the element behavior is too.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13037/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 4, 2026, 9:38 AM UTC (2fe133a)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13037/a5e1501...2fe133a/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 4, 2026, 9:38 AM UTC (2fe133a)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13037/parsing.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 4, 2026, 9:38 AM UTC (2fe133a)\">/parsing.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13037/a5e1501...2fe133a/parsing.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 4, 2026, 9:38 AM UTC (2fe133a)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13037/xhtml.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 4, 2026, 9:38 AM UTC (2fe133a)\">/xhtml.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13037/a5e1501...2fe133a/xhtml.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 4, 2026, 9:38 AM UTC (2fe133a)\">diff</a> )",
